     3667       RUN enable_UI IN THIS-PROCEDURE NO-ERROR.
     3668       RUN set-attribute-list ('ENABLED=yes':U).
     3669       RETURN.
     3670   END PROCEDURE.
     3671   PROCEDURE adm-exit :
     3672        RUN notify ('exit':U).
