     3795         INPUT p-page-list) NO-ERROR.
     3796     END PROCEDURE.
     3797   PROCEDURE select-page :
     3798     DEFINE INPUT PARAMETER p-page#     AS INTEGER   NO-UNDO.
     3799     RUN broker-select-page IN adm-broker-hdl (INPUT THIS-PROCEDURE,
     3800         INPUT p-page#) NO-ERROR.
     3801     END PROCEDURE.
     3802   PROCEDURE view-page :
