     4616   BREAK
     4617   BY sj-goods.is-out DESCENDING
     4618   BY t-3.grp-name :
     4619       assign
     4620       sj-goods.netto-sum = sj-goods.brutto-sum - sj-goods.discnt-sum
     4621       sj-goods.n-u-sum   = (if sj-goods.is-out then 1 else - 1) * (abs(sj-goods.netto-sum) -  abs(sj-goods.uchet-sum))
     4622       sj-goods.u-pcnt =  ( sj-goods.netto-sum / sj-goods.uchet-sum ) * 100.
     4623       ACCUMULATE sj-goods.grp-code (SUB-COUNT BY sj-goods.is-out).
