     4680       ACCUM SUB-TOTAL BY sj-goods.is-out sj-goods.uchet-sum @ sj-goods.uchet-sum
     4681       ACCUM SUB-TOTAL BY sj-goods.is-out sj-goods.n-u-sum @ sj-goods.n-u-sum
     4682       with FRAME SJ-Base .
